WEBVTT

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.350
Ivid mengatakan weffire mencari cukup bagus .

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.940
Kami tidak tersandung di sekitar lagi .

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.900
